category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Generic Hash Table (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "libghthash is a Generic Hash Table which is meant to be easy to extend,
portable, clear in its code and easy to use. You can store any kind of data in
it, regardless of size etc."
